# SYNOPSIS
# Detects and reports Windows Update installation errors from system event logs for Intune compliance monitoring.

# DESCRIPTION
# This script scans the Windows System Event Log for specific Windows Update-related Event IDs 
# generated by the Windows Update Client. It identifies failed update installations by extracting 
# error codes and filtering only relevant updates such as Security Updates, Cumulative Updates, 
# and Windows Updates.

# The script excludes non-relevant entries (e.g., Defender updates, drivers, firmware, and vendor-specific updates) 
# to reduce noise and improve accuracy.

# Detected errors are grouped to remove duplicates and summarized with occurrence counts. 
# The final output is formatted for Intune Proactive Remediation, where:
# - Exit code 1 indicates update failures detected (non-compliant)
# - Exit code 0 indicates no issues found (compliant)

# This helps administrators quickly identify recurring Windows Update failures across devices 
# and take corrective actions efficiently.

# DEMO
# YouTube video link → https://www.youtube.com/@chandermanipandey8763

# NOTES
# Version:         V1.0  
